### Sourcebound — sample requests.
### Works with the VS Code "REST Client" extension or the JetBrains HTTP client.
### Start the server first: uvicorn app.main:app --reload
### Note: Gemini free tier ~20 req/min — space requests ~30s apart.

### Health check (no keys needed)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health

### Answerable question (with graph trace)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is the notice period in the employment agreement?",
  "include_trace": true
}

### Answerable question (citations only)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is the monthly rent and security deposit for the leased unit?"
}

### Out-of-scope question -> grounded refusal, zero citations
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is the capital of France?"
}
